@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
' purpose: n opens a fuzzy picker over configurable task sources; the picked task's prompt opens the queued run
' covers: internal/dashboard/tasksources.go
' covers: internal/dashboard/task_sources.yml
' covers: internal/dashboard/tasksources_test.go
' covers: internal/choiceui/task_picker.go
' covers: internal/choiceui/task_picker_test.go
' covers: internal/dashboard/provider.go
' covers: internal/dashboard/model.go
' covers: internal/dashboard/view.go
' covers: internal/dashboard/mouse.go
' covers: internal/dashboard/layout_test.go
' covers: internal/dashboard/highlight_test.go
' covers: cmd/proveo/main.go
' covers: cmd/proveo/queue_run.go
' covers: cmd/proveo/queue_run_test.go
' covers: internal/run/queue.go
' covers: internal/run/queue_test.go
' covers: internal/run/params.go
' covers: internal/run/run.go
' covers: e2e/dashboard_native_tmux_test.go
'
' "Tasks to do should be: 1. pending files in _plans/, 2. whatever matches the
' git user and the gh (ci/cd pipeline) with an open PR unmerged and 3. if the
' user has Linear, assigned (grab Linear status). Whenever new instance is
' selected, a popup with a fuzzy search input on top with 3 sections should
' display to select a task, then this will be used as the initial prompt."
' Then: "proveo is now aware of task + ci/cd ... Make this configurable,
' extensible. Not digged in code domains." (2026-11-27)
' CHOSEN: plans "Not marked done"; prompt "Pointer, editable"; PRs "my open
' PRs + status, but compress stacks into 1 single task card"; Linear token in
' the workspace .env, "kept from sandboxes".
' SOURCES ARE CONFIG: proveo's defaults are task_sources.yml (embedded, every
' kind documented there); <proveo home>/dashboard.yml tasks.sources replaces
' the list whole. Each source is a section: name, kind, prompt. Kinds:
'   plans    dir, depth, extensions; hide_status words end a plan
'   github   gh pr list --search <search> --state open; stacks folds PRs whose
'            base is another's head into one task, ordered from the base up
'   linear   viewer.assignedIssues minus hide_states types; token from
'            token_var in the environment, else the workspace .env
'   command  run (argv) prints a JSON array of {title, id, status, url, tone,
'            prompt, task}; timeout bounds it: any other tracker plugs in here
' A prompt fills {{field}}s from its task: id title status url, and path and
' slug (plans) or branch prs blockers (github), or what a command prints; a
' source's branch template fills the same fields. Field reference:
'   all kinds ... {{id}} {{title}} {{status}} {{url}}
'   plans ....... {{path}} (repository-relative) {{slug}} (file name, no extension)
'   github ...... {{branch}} (a stack's top head) {{prs}} (a line per PR) {{blockers}}
'   command ..... every field the command prints
' linear hide_states take Linear's state types: triage, backlog, unstarted,
' started, completed, canceled. A command's timeout defaults to 20s.
' PICKER (choiceui.TaskPicker): Blank session first (the old n), then each
' section; a section shows eight rows until a filter is typed ("+N more");
' typing filters every section by fuzzy match (runes in order, runs and word
' starts score higher). ↵ on a task opens its prompt, editable; ↵ again hands
' the terminal to `proveo run --queue --prompt-file <tmp> --task <label>`;
' esc goes back. Sources answer in the background; an answer is reused for a
' minute. --prompt-file (hidden, --queue only) becomes the attended job's
' opening prompt, which the session types once the agent is ready.
' BRANCH (2026-11-27, "ask for a branch name, and default to the pure task management
' name e.g. Linear's CONN-123"): the prompt step has a Branch field (tab moves
' between prompt and branch; spaces become dashes), filled from the source's
' branch template: {{slug}} for a plan, {{branch}} (the PR's head, a stack's top)
' for github, {{id}} for Linear. Start passes --branch; the instance works on that
' branch, from its tip on origin when origin has it (a PR's branch), else from
' the checkout's base, and the hook pushes it. No branch keeps proveo/<instance>,
' which never leaves the machine (git-sync-turn.puml). proveo/ names are refused.
' TICKET (2026-11-28): a pick hands its url (Linear, github) or path (plans) to
' --ticket, hidden and --queue only, so the queued job's Ticket names it; the
' task graph links tasks by it (task-graph.puml). A plan's status shows its
' blocked_by refs: "planned · blocked by usage-meter, CONN-7".
' HOST-ONLY: LINEAR_API_KEY is a personal token. credentials.HostOnlyVars drop
' it from every staged .env (clone-workspace.puml); the merge home keeps the
' host's own value. Before this, Task Details read Linear only from the
' dashboard's own environment, which never had a key: proveo saw git and gh.
' MEASURED 2026-11-27 in the pluvo monorepo: 46 plans with no status line, 6
' open PRs (an 8-PR PLUV-1402 stack as one task: 7 ready · 1 conflicts), 54
' assigned Linear issues; plans and Linear answer in about a second, gh in 2.5 s.
title Task picker — configurable sources, one prompt per pick

file "task_sources.yml\nproveo's defaults" as DEF <<app>>
file "<proveo home>/dashboard.yml\ntasks.sources" as CFG <<host>>
component "plans · github · linear\ncommand (any tracker)" as KINDS <<async>>
component "TaskPicker\nfilter · sections · prompt" as PICK <<app>>
component "proveo run --queue\n--prompt-file · --task" as RUN <<app>>

DEF ARROW_OPTIONAL KINDS : unless replaced
CFG ARROW_MAIN KINDS : replaces the list
KINDS ARROW_MAIN PICK : one section each
PICK ARROW_MAIN RUN : ↵ pick, ↵ start

note right of CFG
  **Sources are config, not code.**
  A new tracker is a command source
  that prints JSON; no proveo release
  is needed to add one.
end note

note bottom of PICK
  **The pick is a pointer.**
  Its prompt names the plan, PRs or
  issue; the agent reads the rest, and
  the operator edits it first.
end note
@enduml
